Command log for adding prices and colour to the milky_os scraper and rebuilding the page as a Vue 3 server rendered site under scraper2.
One line per command. UTC timestamp then the command then what happened.
2026-09-14T13:06:21Z ls milky_os/scraper -- 137 articles in products.json under 14 brands with no price field and eleven generated view pages.
2026-09-14T13:06:21Z python scan of .cache for a price key -- the dm detail payload already carries price.current and a per kilo unit price so the dm price costs no new request.
2026-09-14T13:10:47Z curl probe of fourteen German shops for a GTIN search -- mueller kaufland rossmann idealo amazon ebay medpex docmorris and eurapon answer 403 or a client challenge so they are out.
2026-09-14T13:10:47Z curl probe of the survivors -- sanicare returns a promotion page for any query disapo returns an empty shell and babymarkt and baby-walz answer 429 behind a rate limit.
2026-09-14T13:10:47Z curl shop-apotheke.com/search.htm -- the page embeds the whole Algolia result so ean pzn price pricePerUnit packSize and deeplink come out of one request.
2026-09-14T13:10:47Z curl shop-apotheke by its own ean 4062300402409 -- an exact ean query returns the one hit so the matcher can try the barcode first and fall back to the name.
2026-09-14T13:14:40Z pnpm install nuxt 4.5.2 in milky_os/scraper2 -- the Vue 3 server rendered app has its toolchain and node_modules is ignored.
2026-09-14T13:14:40Z patch dmscrape/client.py -- get_bytes and get_text sit under the existing pacing and cache so a shop page is read on the same terms as a dm service.
2026-09-14T13:14:40Z .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -- 94 tests still pass after the client split.
2026-09-14T13:16:31Z cat > dmscrape/prices/match.py -- a candidate is refused unless the maker the age step and the pack size all agree and the recipe markers do not conflict.
2026-09-14T13:16:31Z python check of seven matcher cases -- Aptamil Ha Pre was scoring 0.75 against Aptamil Pronutra Pre so the marker subset guard now refuses it at zero.
2026-09-14T13:18:29Z cat > dmscrape/prices/{models,__init__}.py and sources/{dm,shopapotheke,volksversand}.py -- three adapters behind one collector that records the site the title the price the pack size the link and how the match was made.
2026-09-14T13:18:29Z python3 tools/fetch_prices.py --limit 4 -- dm answered four of four and shop-apotheke two of four so the pipeline works end to end.
2026-09-14T13:18:29Z python3 tools/fetch_prices.py -- started the full run over 137 articles.
2026-09-14T13:21:45Z node validate_palette.js on the categorical palette against a white card -- eight slots pass every gate and three sit under 3 to 1 so a table twin is required.
2026-09-14T13:21:45Z node validate_palette.js --ordinal on the blue ramp -- seven age steps cannot be drawn as one hue because no subset above step 250 clears the 0,06 lightness gap so colour never carries the age step.
2026-09-14T13:21:45Z node validate_palette.js on both diverging arms against white -- blue 250 400 600 and red pass as ordinal ramps so deviation from the step median is the encoding that carries the difference.
2026-09-14T13:21:45Z cat > tools/export_dataset.py -- one compact dataset of 231 kB holding 109 articles 43 nutrients the step medians and the offers.
2026-09-14T13:29:28Z python3 tools/fetch_prices.py over 137 articles -- 260 requests in four minutes gave 238 offers with no failures.
2026-09-14T13:29:28Z python audit of the widest spreads -- a six bottle pack read as one bottle and 1.200 g read as 1,2 g so the size reader now handles the German thousands mark and a multiplier.
2026-09-14T13:29:28Z patch dmscrape/prices/match.py -- a goat recipe was matching a cow recipe so a declared feature must now agree on both sides.
2026-09-14T13:29:28Z patch dmscrape/prices/match.py -- Milupa Aptamil was matching Milupa Milumil so a maker word is only dropped when it is the maker of one of the two articles.
2026-09-14T13:29:28Z python3 tools/fetch_prices.py from the cache -- the tightened matcher keeps 218 offers and the widest spread fell from 24 times to 1,96 times.
